        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1204113",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ei once again",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120410601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120410601": {
            "id": "120410601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Have you finally defeated her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410602"
            ]
          },
          "120410602": {
            "id": "120410602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Raiden Shogun",
            "text": "It appears your martial prowess has not dulled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410603"
            ]
          },
          "120410603": {
            "id": "120410603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Raiden Shogun",
            "text": "But how long can your will remain strong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410604"
            ]
          },
          "120410604": {
            "id": "120410604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How the heck...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410605"
            ]
          },
          "120410605": {
            "id": "120410605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Surely the Shogun puppet isn't invincible...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410606"
            ]
          },
          "120410606": {
            "id": "120410606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "In this realm of consciousness, her existence is tenacious indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410607"
            ]
          },
          "120410607": {
            "id": "120410607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "She was built to resist erosion. Her will is stronger than any other living being's, including you and me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410608"
            ]
          },
          "120410608": {
            "id": "120410608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then... does that mean this is gonna be a never-ending battle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410609"
            ]
          },
          "120410609": {
            "id": "120410609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Maybe. But I have to prove to her that my present will is no product of erosion. The future I shall forge will be a grand undertaking, one that will be resistant to erosion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410610"
            ]
          },
          "120410610": {
            "id": "120410610",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "If I don't do this, the Shogun's rules can never change, and Inazuma can never move forward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410611"
            ]
          },
          "120410611": {
            "id": "120410611",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "This is my duty. No matter how long this battle may last, months, years, centuries... And no matter how many times we must fight, I will defeat her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410612"
            ]
          },
          "120410612": {
            "id": "120410612",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What will happen to Inazuma in the meantime?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410613"
            ]
          },
          "120410613": {
            "id": "120410613",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Five hundred years ago, humanity proved their strength in battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410614"
            ]
          },
          "120410614": {
            "id": "120410614",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Here in the present, they rely on their ambition to challenge wayward practices, tear them out like the diseased wood of an old sakura tree, so that new, healthy branches might spring to life in their place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410615"
            ]
          },
          "120410615": {
            "id": "120410615",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "It is about time that I learned to trust them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410618"
            ]
          },
          "120410618": {
            "id": "120410618",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "I understand that. But if the dreams of which Makoto spoke are true eternity, a short moment for which the Shogun does not exist is nothing to fear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410619"
            ]
          },
          "120410619": {
            "id": "120410619",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "I fight for the everlasting future of Inazuma. However long the battle may last, it is but a drop in the ocean of eternity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410620"
            ]
          },
          "120410620": {
            "id": "120410620",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "I vow to the subjects of Inazuma that I shall one day return. This is my oath. Please be my witness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410621"
            ]
          },
          "120410621": {
            "id": "120410621",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "During my absence, I place everything in Miko's hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410622"
            ]
          },
          "120410622": {
            "id": "120410622",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But, but this means that—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410623"
            ]
          },
          "120410623": {
            "id": "120410623",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ei",
            "text": "Pass on my words.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410624"
            ]
          },
          "120410624": {
            "id": "120410624",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ei!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120410625"
            ]
          },
          "120410625": {
            "id": "120410625",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
